  "__comment": "Vanilla flowers -> TFC plants (tfc:plant/<x>), with name/closest-match fixed defaults plus a candidate pool (mctfc:subst/plant/flower, keyed on the converted result) so the player can re-pick any TFC flower via the Replace GUI. Potted flowers (minecraft:potted_<x>) map the same way to TFC's own potted plant blocks (tfc:plant/potted/<x>). Double-tall vanilla flowers (sunflower/lilac/rose_bush/peony) map to TFC two-tall plants via copy_properties {half:part} (vanilla uses 'half', TFC uses 'part'; both serialize lower/upper), with a tall_flower pool. Edit/reload with /reload.",
